If the effect of news pressure is driven by this instrument that only has 27 events in 31 years, and no scandals happen after a major event, then we could only observe a negative effect in this case. In a sense, this instrument is forcing news pressure to take on high values in 27 cases where the outcome is 0, thereby ensuring a nonpositive result.#
